  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tSelf Assessment \n\t\tSelf Assessment Help Guide\n\n### How to bring forward Capital Allowances into current SA100\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 5 Jul, 2022 at 12:48 PM\n\n\t\tLocation: \n\nCreate SA100 > Add supplementary page for Self Employment > Net profits or loss > Capital Allowances > Capital Allowance Calculator > Select Tax Return > Import B/Fwd Data  \n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nHelp Guide:\n\nIn the example below you can see two tax returns for 2020/21 (prior year) and 2021/22 (current year). \n\nThis new enhancement will give you the ability to bring forward all capital allowances entered from previous returns into the current submission.\n\nNOTE: ensure you have added the capital allowance in the prior year and have created the supplementary page for 'Self Employment' in the current tax return. \n\nNavigate into the Self Employment supplementary page > Net profit(loss), Tax, allowances and Taxable profit(loss).\n\nGo into the Capital Allowance tab and click on 'Capital Allowance Calculator'.\n\nSelect the prior year tax return and click on 'Import B/Fwd Data.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115347\">Self Assessment </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188542\">Self Assessment Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to bring forward Capital Allowances into current SA100\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 5 Jul, 2022 at 12:48 PM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Location:&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Create SA100 &gt; Add supplementary page for Self Employment &gt; Net profits or loss &gt; Capital Allowances &gt; Capital Allowance Calculator &gt; Select Tax Return &gt; Import B/Fwd Data &nbsp;</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Video Tutorial:</strong></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br></p><p><span class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\"></span></p><div class=\"fr-draggable\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/d0ffc62bf3e44f3fa6050d2a5feecb26\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><strong>Help Guide:</strong></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">In the example below you can see two tax returns for 2020/21 (prior year) and 2021/22 (current year).&nbsp;</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">This new enhancement will give you the ability to bring forward all capital allowances entered from previous returns into the current submission.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9162793101/original/buIioejqED6AFGX-_ACwQCPiFtZassmmdA.png?1657020659\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9162793101\"></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;\">NOTE: ensure you have added the capital allowance in the prior year and have created the supplementary page for 'Self Employment' in the current tax return.</span>&nbsp;</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Navigate into the Self Employment supplementary page &gt; Net profit(loss), Tax, allowances and Taxable profit(loss).</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9162793277/original/v0kZUxFq2Kg4H7LjQ4cGTOoP6Y7ljl-iPQ.png?1657020798\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9162793277\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Go into the Capital Allowance tab and click on 'Capital Allowance Calculator'.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9162793383/original/EhHTdvW_W3lgVkVUsLhG0iaFhENJJw1RWQ.png?1657020880\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9162793383\"></span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\">Select the prior year tax return and click on 'Import B/Fwd Data.</span></span></p><p style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><br></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9162793720/original/Qzq85YuiQ-zWr9v9aQKXYEMPOFB_mOJTpw.gif?1657021132\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9162793720\"></span></p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000216928\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000216928/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000216928\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000216928/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000216928\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-hide-dom=\"#voting-container\" data-show-dom=\"#vote-feedback-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo</span><